    ('1a9c8fcb-2a76-56de-b019-9c1f23a19800'::uuid, 'drawdown-deploy-enhanced-rock-weathering',
     'A link or photo of your explainer with sources listed.',
     'Research and explain only; don''t spread rock dust or run field experiments.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-enhanced-rock-weathering), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Enhanced rock weathering removes CO₂ from the air by accelerating the natural chemical and physical breakdown of certain rocks. This carbon removal practice can be effective and has been deployed in pilot and small-scale commercial projects.',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/deploy-enhanced-rock-weathering', null, null, null),
    ('2bab59bf-f317-5962-bdaa-2ee1ebbb664a'::uuid, 'drawdown-reduce-grazing-intensity',
     'A link or photo of your explainer with sources listed.',
     'Stick to reliable sources, and if you visit grazing land, stay on public trails and away from livestock.',
     'Solution summary from Project Drawdown (https://drawdown.org/explorer/reduce-grazing-intensity), used with permission. Adapted: the mission wording is original.',
     'Reducing grazing intensity involves lowering ruminant livestock stocking rates or grazing pressure. This removes carbon from the atmosphere by reducing land damage and increasing soil organic carbon (SOC).',
     'Solution summary © Project Drawdown, used with permission.',
     'https://drawdown.org/explorer/reduce-grazing-intensity', null, null, null),
    ('3f646f9c-5619-54ed-b38a-3977d359c61c'::uuid, 'drawdown-restore-large-herbivores',
     'A photo or link to your poster or post with sources listed.',
